  "_instructions": {
    "title": "How to Add Real Token Images",
    "steps": [
      "1. Find CC0/Public Domain token images from sources like:",
      "   - reddit.com/r/dndmaps (search 'tokens')",
      "   - 2minutetabletop.com/product-category/tokens/",
      "   - roll20.net marketplace (filter free)",
      "   - token-creator tools (see TOKENS.md)",
      "",
      "2. Place token images in: static/assets/tokens/",
      "   - Use PNG format with transparency",
      "   - Recommended size: 200x200px to 512x512px",
      "   - Name format: category-name-number.png",
      "",
      "3. Update this tokens.json file:",
      "   - Copy an existing token entry",
      "   - Update all fields (id, name, filename, size, tags)",
      "   - Set isPlaceholder to false",
      "   - Add proper attribution if required",
      "",
      "4. The TokenBrowser component will automatically load your tokens!",
      "",
      "Token sizes:",
      "   - tiny: <5ft (items, small objects)",
      "   - small: 5ft (goblins, halflings)",
      "   - medium: 5ft (humans, most PCs)",
      "   - large: 10ft (horses, ogres)",
      "   - huge: 15ft (giants, young dragons)",
      "   - gargantuan: 20ft+ (ancient dragons, titans)"
    ]
  }
}
